A||||5||LemonSky||Fiero engine in a Lamborghini?||||11||
Z||000000||LemonSky||08-02-2000||09:18 PM||||Get this, I was driving South on Interstate 75/85 in Atlanta, heading to my downtown home when someone pulled up to my side and yelled if I'd like to sell my car. I yelled for his number which he screamed to me. Fortunately, I have a strong memory, so I called him when I got home. He said he's looking for Fieros so he could install their engines in the body of Lamborghinis (sic?) But he obviously bristled at my asking price of $4000.00 (it's a 1986 V6, gold, automatic), but hey, the car is in excellent condition and I have little desire to sell it now, although I intend on selling it before moving West this upcoming March. And trust me, I know it's almost wishful thinking to get that much despite the fact it's given me or my family little problems in the fifteen years it's been with us. But I said I'd call him months from now with a willingness to negotiate.<P><BR>Oh, well, I thought I'd share this interesting encounter.||||reg||11
Z||000001||pollock||08-03-2000||09:41 AM||||sounds like he wants to do a kit car but doesn't know the first thing about it||||reg||1
Z||000002||b lo 0||08-03-2000||10:17 AM||||Sounds like the guy was pretty dumb.  What's that?  You're leaving our lovely traffic-jammed, moron-infested (before any of yall flame me, I'm talking about the morons that DO THEIR MAKEUP and EAT and BAKE A CAKE while their driving) city to go west?  What's wrong with you?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  No really, after I get out of college I'm going to Seattle.  Tell the guy with the Lambo (probably a cake-baker) that if he can tell you how to build a kit, you'll give him the Fiero.  You'll have that car forever.<P>PS-Before you start yelling at me because you think I hate Atlanta, I was born here, lived here my whole life, and I love atlanta-just not all the people that live here.<P>------------------<BR>'85 GT (in progress)  <BR>titled ICE-plates B LO 0 <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.angelfire.com/ga3/audioimagery/ice.gif">    <BR>Go to <A HREF="http://www.audioimagery.i-p.com" TARGET=_blank>www.audioimagery.i-p.com</A>  !!!||||reg||1
